        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur GEOPAR, Georgetown Rose With Parthenon Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe simplicity of Georgetown's Rosette design combined with the Parthenon Beaded Knob will enhance the elegance of your home. The Georgetown Rosette With Parthenon Knob has a regal appearance that is only heightens by the available finishes--all of them beautiful. The classic styling of Georgetown Series makes this style both a standout and a standard in decorative door hardware. Universally utilized as an expression of tasteful glamor it captures a discrete, yet stately look. It will fit doors 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\" thick with a 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backset. Available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nClick here to see the entire <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-decorative\"><b>Grandeur</b></a> - <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-georgetown-series\"><b>Georgetown Series</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur GEOPAR Georgetown Rosette With Parthenon Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Made out of solid forged brass.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Georgetown Rose With Parthenon Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Georgetown Rosette Diameter: 2.62\"</li>\r\n<li>Parthenon Knob Diameter: 2.28\"</li>\r\n<li>Parthenon Knob Projection: 2.15\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-GEOPAR-Specifcations.pdf?v=1704262181\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur GEOPAR Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting A Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for both sides of door. These inactive pulls are usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two knobs.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside with a push-button.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Georgetown Rosette With Parthenon Knob",
                "description": "Grandeur GEOPAR, Georgetown Rose With Parthenon Knob - The simplicity of Georgetown's Rosette design combined with the Parthenon Beaded Knob will enhance the elegance of your home. The Georgetown Rosette With Parthenon Knob has a regal appearance that is only heightens by the available finishes--all of them beautiful. The classic styling of Georgetown Series makes this style both a standout and a standard in decorative door hardware. Universally utilized as an expression of tasteful glamor it captures a discrete, yet stately look. It will fit doors 1-3/8 inches to 1-3/4 inches thick with a 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches backset. Available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions.",
